{"id":"504747","name":"山药鸡脚响螺汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/504747/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"1根"},{"name":"鸡脚","amount":"15个"},{"name":"猪骨","amount":"500g"},{"name":"响螺头","amount":"4个"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"10个"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"手抓2把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"响螺头用水泡一下。","img":"images/504747/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪骨出血水，洗去浮沫。","img":"images/504747/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡脚切去指甲，和响螺头一起飞水，洗净。","img":"images/504747/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"响螺切小块。","img":"images/504747/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"山药去皮切块。","img":"images/504747/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"红枣去核。","img":"images/504747/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把以上材料放入电压力锅，注入水到10杯的刻度，按煲汤键开煮。","img":"images/504747/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煲好排气后，打开盖子，撇去肥油。","img":"images/504747/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"枸杞子洗净。","img":"images/504747/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入汤中，盖上盖子焖10分钟。(枸杞子不宜久煮，汤好后再放入焖10分钟即可。)","img":"images/504747/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"汤好了。(响螺有咸味，不需再加盐)","img":"images/504747/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"滋阴养颜。","img":"images/504747/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}